146
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,000
Sound good?

147
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Intentionality, interruptibility.

148
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:13,000
And for those of you who love to take notes, somehow, some way, by the grace of God and the power of the Holy Spirit,

149
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:16,000
I have notes on the back of your, on your bulletin.

150
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
